..!interpreter german translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : ow1/IS.CLOSEOI.AUTODEB
.. Date           : 23.01.14
.. Version        : 2012r4n05
.. Author         : chbo/abas AG
.. Copyright      : (c) 2014 abas AG
.. Functionality  :
..
.. Interface (arguments and their meaning)
..    uses array argument (arg.i)           : no
..    uses name argument  (xpname=value)    : no
..
..    Argument     meaning
..    -------------------------------------------------------------------------
..
.. Program flow   : Create an EDP import file of a debit for the selected
..                  outstanding item and import in the background via .system
...Includes       : None
..*****************************************************************************
..
.art text  xtfile                 ? F|defined( U|xtfile )      = G|False
.art text  xtcommand              ? F|defined( U|xtcommand )   = G|False
.art text  xtdelete               ? F|defined( U|xtdelete )    = G|False
.art datum xdbudat                ? F|defined( U|xdbudat )     = G|False
..
.weiter NODATA ? F|empty(M|opid) = G|True
..
.formel U|xtfile = "ow1/DEBOI.EDP"
.formel U|xtcommand = "edpimport.sh -p " + 'G|einmalpw' + " -I " + 'U|xtfile'
.formel U|xtdelete = "rm " + 'U|xtfile'
.formel U|xdbudat = M|budat + 20
.. .formel U|xdbudat = G|datum
..
.. Create EDP file
.eingabe DATEI.F
.ausgabe auf 'U|xtfile'
..
.. Set header information
#!EDP_LANG=D
#!database=4:3
#!action=PAYMENT
#!recordidfld=id
#!menuchoice=offene Posten ausbuchen
#!charset=eks
#!FIRSTTABFLD=tabnr
#!dontchange=-
id;beleg;beldat;budat;gkonto;tabnr;tophist;sksatz;skbetr;0:kladen;bubetr
..
.. Set import lines
;DSIMPORT;'M|vom';'U|xdbudat';18100;+1;'M|opid';0;0;;'M|rebetr'
..
.. Close file
.ausgabe auf WERF.WEG
.eingabe BILD.F
.ausgabe BILDSCHIRM
..
.. Execute edpimport.sh with the created file
.system 'U|xtcommand' HINTER
.weiter ERRORCMD ? G|mehr = G|False
.. .system 'U|xtdelete' HINTER
.weiter ERRORFILE ? G|mehr = G|False
.. Success message
.hinweis -sofort Open item 'M|opid^num100' was sucessfully debited.
.weiter
..
!ERRORCMD
.. Message if EDP command does not complete successfully
.hinweis -sofort Error executing EDP command for open item 'M|opid^num100'.
.. .system 'U|xtdelete' HINTER
.weiter ERRORFILE ? G|mehr = G|False
.weiter
..
!ERRORFILE
.. Message if temporary EDP file is not delete successfully
.hinweis -sofort Error deleting temporary EDP file 'U|xtfile'.
.weiter
..
!NODATA
.. Message if there is no data in the selected line
.hinweis -sofort Line contains no data!
